This repository contains tools for working with Fannie Mae loan performance data.

The data accessed by this software is proprietary and governed by Fannie Mae's
terms of use. For all questions regarding data usage, licensing, and permissions,
please refer to:

    https://capitalmarkets.fanniemae.com/credit-risk-transfer/single-family-credit-risk-transfer/fannie-mae-single-family-loan-performance-data
